      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jefferson%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Brewer Gold Mine, located just west of Jefferson, was one of the oldest and most productive gold mines in the eastern United States.",
